message: "If you use this OCT research corpus, please cite it as follows."
title: "OCT Research Corpus — Data-Driven Agentic Literature Review"
abstract: "Data-driven, auto-validated literature review corpus for optical coherence tomography (OCT), from clinical retinal imaging to in-process laser-welding depth monitoring. Papers live in papers.yaml; everything else (README, statistics, concept graph, reports) is generated by the pipeline."
